Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.64,0:00:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,光輝到底是從哪裡來的呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.24,0:00:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,還差一點
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.88,0:00:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,就差一點了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.31,0:00:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,哇...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.44,0:00:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.41,0:00:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,好痛啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.01,0:01:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,妳怎麼還在賴床 上學要遲到了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.42,0:01:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,哎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.26,0:01:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn萝莉体-DDC.yolan}Hello Everybody
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.43,0:01:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,從今天開始就是第二季了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.01,0:01:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,第二季？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.69,0:01:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,就是指第二學期啦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.35,0:01:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,話說回來 千歌好慢啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.77,0:01:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,才說今後要自己一個人起床 就馬上遲到
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.23,0:01:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我和妳說了 這是要進行理事長的問候吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.86,0:01:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,這裡要說 希望妳們要注意浦之星學院學生的身份
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.63,0:01:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,言行要有分寸 學習努力上進
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.99,0:01:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,持有節操？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.38,0:01:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,分寸！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.81,0:01:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,不過說起來還真是有點可惜呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.44,0:01:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,聽說還差一點就能進入全國大賽了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.04,0:01:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,發生過的事情 一直再說也沒用滋啦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.41,0:01:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.87,0:01:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,參加獎居然是雙色原子筆是什麼意思啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.56,0:02:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,也許進入決賽就會變成三色原子筆呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.73,0:02:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,這就是未來滋啦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.59,0:02:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,哪有啦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.64,0:02:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn萝莉体-DDC.yolan}Shut up！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.83,0:02:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,沒能進入全國大賽的確非常遺憾
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.52,0:02:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我們將0變成1
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.77,0:02:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,這都是靠在座各位的努力
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.38,0:02:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,然後 現在
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.10,0:02:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,想入學的人也從1變成了10
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.13,0:02:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,的確
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.64,0:02:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,還不只這些哦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.07,0:02:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,今天將發表下一屆{\fn萝莉体-DDC.yolan}LoveLive{\fn}的消息
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.45,0:02:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn萝莉体-DDC.yolan}LoveLive？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.17,0:02:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,真的嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.36,0:02:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.80,0:02:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,同樣的 決勝站在秋葉原巨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.80,0:02:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn萝莉体-DDC.yolan}Too late
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.10,0:02:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,妳遲到很久了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.41,0:02:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,下一次的LoveLive
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.14,0:02:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,千歌
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.25,0:02:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,妳準備怎麼做啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.54,0:02:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我認為是不需要問的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.87,0:02:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,善子也早就在等著了滋啦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.97,0:02:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.66,0:02:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,叫我夜羽
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.96,0:03:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,去參加LoveLive吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.78,0:03:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,然後..然後把一變成十
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.32,0:03:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,把十變成百拯救學校
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.85,0:03:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣一來..
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.93,0:03:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣一來..
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.92,0:03:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣我想 就能找到只屬於我們的光輝了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.45,0:03:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,一定可以
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.37,0:03:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我們能閃耀
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.79,0:03:32.16,OP_TW,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}用盡全力去拚搏
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.44,0:03:41.35,OP_TW,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}將未來掌握在自己手中吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.31,0:03:51.59,OP_TW,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}天空和大海 都是我的夥伴
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.99,0:03:54.01,OP_TW,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}高喊著加油
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.02,0:03:55.83,OP_TW,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}閃閃發光
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.97,0:03:59.19,OP_TW,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}彷彿要將聲音
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.30,0:04:02.17,OP_TW,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}傳遍全世界一般
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.53,0:04:07.24,OP_TW,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}大聲喊出夢想吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.25,0:04:09.27,OP_TW,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}充滿希望的今天
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.27,0:04:13.18,OP_TW,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}會帶來更美好的明天
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.55,0:04:18.03,OP_TW,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}緊握心形的磁石奔跑
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.20,0:04:21.72,OP_TW,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}好好享受當下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.13,0:04:24.29,OP_TW,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}無論何時都要在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.29,0:04:27.06,OP_TW,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}未來想要怎樣呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.12,0:04:32.57,OP_TW,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}大家都在尋找夢想的形狀
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.69,0:04:34.94,OP_TW,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}哭泣著歡笑著
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.94,0:04:37.72,OP_TW,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}未來的我們
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.76,0:04:43.33,OP_TW,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}一定知道那個答案
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.39,0:04:48.25,OP_TW,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}拼盡全力
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.31,0:04:51.35,OP_TW,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}化為閃耀的風兒
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.36,0:04:54.45,OP_TW,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}We got dream
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.19,0:05:01.90,title1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(427.5,907.5)\blur6\fad(200,200)}#1 Next Step
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.43,0:05:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,一二三四.....好了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.99,0:05:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,善子妳的身體還是一如既往的僵硬啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.06,0:05:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,有好好在做伸展嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.03,0:05:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,叫我夜羽
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.51,0:05:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣可不行
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.95,0:05:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,要像這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.37,0:05:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}痛痛痛痛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.12,0:05:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.41,0:05:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,這個身體說穿了不過只是假借的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.07,0:05:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,墮天使的真身是..
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.64,0:05:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}啊痛痛痛痛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.84,0:05:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,花丸變得很靈活了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.65,0:05:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,每天都在家裡做伸展滋啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.28,0:05:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,而且伏地挺身也是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.86,0:05:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,真的嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.70,0:05:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,看好了滋啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.77,0:05:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,1…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.39,0:05:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,很完美滋啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.69,0:05:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,花丸真厲害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.80,0:05:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn萝莉体-DDC.yolan}It's Miracle
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.98,0:05:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,哪裡是奇蹟了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.33,0:05:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,話說回來 下次LoveLive是什麼時候？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.46,0:05:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,大概是明年春天
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.80,0:05:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不對不對
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.33,0:05:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,在這之前還有一件事情要做
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.21,0:05:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.92,0:05:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,忘了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.44,0:06:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,要募集希望入學我們學校的人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.41,0:06:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,學校說明會
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.86,0:06:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 對耶
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.46,0:06:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn萝莉体-DDC.yolan}Of Course{\fn} 已經發出佈告了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.36,0:06:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,這是個好機會
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.07,0:06:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,給前來參觀的人開一場 Live
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.84,0:06:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,將這所學校的魅力傳達給她們
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.73,0:06:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,這個主意不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.32,0:06:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我覺得這個點子非常好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.56,0:06:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,廁所去太久了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.87,0:06:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,練習早就開始了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.73,0:06:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,現在是在意他人的時候嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.58,0:06:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,呀痛痛痛痛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.81,0:06:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣啊 到了秋天 末班車就提早了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.71,0:06:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,是這樣的滋啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.07,0:06:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,太陽下山也早了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.16,0:06:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,放學後的練習時間可能也要縮短了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.79,0:06:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,到說明會可剩沒幾天了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.79,0:06:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.28,0:06:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,不好好考慮一下練習時間的話
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.59,0:07:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,早上提前兩小時集合怎麼樣？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.25,0:07:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,那就這麼決定了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.43,0:07:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,太快了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.29,0:07:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,還是說 善子妳家裡的人叫妳要早點回去嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.97,0:07:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,妳怎麼知道這個
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.90,0:07:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我媽媽在LoveLive的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.45,0:07:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,好像和善子媽媽聊了各式各樣的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.39,0:07:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,在墮天使的名義下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.81,0:07:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,善子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.32,0:07:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,開門
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.35,0:07:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,叫我夜羽
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.80,0:07:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,好像連房間都不讓她進來的樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.48,0:07:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,那是因為夜羽是墮天使
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.79,0:07:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,母親不過是暫時的同居人罷了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.96,0:07:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,妳媽媽是個怎麼樣的人啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.98,0:07:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,聽說是學校的老師
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.99,0:07:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,她媽媽說 善子到幼稚園為止都離不開奶嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.01,0:07:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,啊啊啊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.31,0:07:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 沼津到這裡的公車會不會到很晚都有？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.16,0:07:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,因為有工作要回去的人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.02,0:08:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我們在那裡練習就好了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.77,0:08:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣就能掌握時間了滋啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.31,0:08:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,露比贊成
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.82,0:08:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣也好 鞠莉呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.34,0:08:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,哎 {\fn萝莉体-DDC.yolan}No problem
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.78,0:08:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,好 那就決定了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.59,0:08:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,明天大家一起去尋找可以練習的地方吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.22,0:08:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,要增加新的小惡魔囉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.11,0:08:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,善子妳太興奮了滋啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.32,0:08:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,叫我夜羽
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.96,0:08:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,再見
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.38,0:08:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,真美啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.71,0:08:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.58,0:08:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我啊 雖然只有一瞬間
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.69,0:08:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,真的只有一瞬間
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.75,0:08:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,有點明白了 在那個會場和大家一起唱歌一起閃耀
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.61,0:08:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,是怎麼樣的感覺
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.84,0:08:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,真的嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.93,0:08:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 當然
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.23,0:09:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然還很模糊不清 但我們一定能閃耀
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.42,0:09:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,努力的話絕對可以做到 我是這麼認為的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.07,0:09:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 雖然可能會很辛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.15,0:09:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣才好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.03,0:09:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,但是爸爸不是和我約好了 說好會等待的嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.95,0:09:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,現在突然...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.32,0:09:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.93,0:09:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,發生什麼事？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.68,0:09:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn萝莉体-DDC.yolan}Sorry I can't speak japanese
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.23,0:09:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,一定出了什麼事對吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.14,0:09:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,妳在說什麼啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.32,0:10:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,小心我告妳哦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.90,0:10:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn萝莉体-DDC.yolan}Wait Wait
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.29,0:10:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,真沒辦法呢 其實...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.52,0:10:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,其實...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.76,0:10:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,最近體重稍微增加了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.34,0:10:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我感到很鬱悶..
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.49,0:10:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,騙人的吧 一點都沒變
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.77,0:10:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,妳怎麼知道啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.29,0:10:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是知道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.50,0:10:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,而且鞠莉也不是會因為這種事情就感到憂鬱的人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.07,0:10:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,發生了什麼事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.23,0:10:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,鞠莉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.53,0:10:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,該怎麼辦才好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.67,0:10:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,鞠莉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.00,0:10:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,千歌妳找到好的地方了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.11,0:10:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,找不到啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.52,0:10:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,滋啦丸家是經營寺廟的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.23,0:10:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有大廳這類的地方嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.11,0:10:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我家的寺廟真的可以嗎滋啦？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.78,0:10:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,還有我家太遠了 不行的滋拉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.55,0:11:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,那善子家也不錯啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.27,0:11:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我家哪有空間啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.07,0:11:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,說起來 黛雅她們人呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.68,0:11:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,剛剛還在的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.89,0:11:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,鞠莉好像去接電話了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.37,0:11:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,已經沒有逆轉的可能了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.43,0:11:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,不 還沒
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.30,0:11:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,果南
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.51,0:11:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,黛雅知道嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.89,0:11:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能說的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.15,0:11:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,那就好好隱藏起來啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.04,0:11:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,黛雅
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.98,0:11:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,之前就偷偷摸摸的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.95,0:11:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,真的是大錯特錯了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.67,0:11:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.65,0:11:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,好寬敞
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.30,0:11:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,真厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.17,0:11:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,這裡拉開還有鏡子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.97,0:11:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,準備前往鏡中世界
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.57,0:11:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,住手啊滋啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.31,0:12:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,這個地方是我爸爸的熟人租下來的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.87,0:12:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,但是他說暫時用不到
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.93,0:12:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,不塊是船長
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.31,0:12:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,跟這沒什麼關係吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.63,0:12:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,而且回去的路上有好多商店
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.93,0:12:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不要老是想著玩
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.88,0:12:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,還有書店滋啦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.69,0:12:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,梨子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.99,0:12:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,那接下來 我們確認一下隊形吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.65,0:12:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.62,0:12:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.00,0:12:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,在這之前 我有話要說
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.45,0:12:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,有話要說？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.96,0:12:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 事實上...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.73,0:12:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,鞠莉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.47,0:12:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,其實 學校說明會被中止了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.92,0:12:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn萝莉体-DDC.yolan}LoveLive Sunshine！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.21,0:12:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,被中止了？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.17,0:12:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.44,0:12:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,就是字面上的意思
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.51,0:12:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,說明會取消
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.61,0:13:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,浦之星將會從明年開始正式停止招生
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.27,0:13:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,不會吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.34,0:13:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,太突然了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.73,0:13:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊滋啦 第二學期才剛剛開始
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.49,0:13:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.38,0:13:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,從學生角度來看 可能會是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.96,0:13:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,但是學校方面 在兩年前 就已經開始和其他學校商討合併了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.26,0:13:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,這已經是鞠莉努力說服她爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.07,0:13:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,才會一直延到現在的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.24,0:13:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 希望入學的人數不是增加了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.09,0:13:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,剛開始一個人都沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.07,0:13:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,到現在我們已經有十個人了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.85,0:13:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,現在開始 還會有更多人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.95,0:13:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,這個當然也說過了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.12,0:13:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 只有這個理由
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.88,0:13:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,還不能讓他改變主意
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.91,0:13:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,鞠莉 他在哪裡？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.39,0:13:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,千歌
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.13,0:13:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我去跟他說
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.33,0:13:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,千歌 等等 他現在在美國
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.94,0:13:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,鞠莉的爸爸 現在在美國
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.43,0:13:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,是這樣的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.19,0:13:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.73,0:13:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我會問美渡姐姐 志滿姐姐 還有媽媽借錢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.11,0:13:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,還會把自己的零用錢都提前預支出來
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.88,0:13:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,借到更多的錢去美國
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.12,0:14:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,然後告訴他 希望讓他再等一等
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.70,0:14:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,千歌
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.87,0:14:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,妳覺得能實現嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.56,0:14:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定可以
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.50,0:14:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,這時候就該用到我的能力
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.04,0:14:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,鞠莉很喜歡這所學校 很喜歡這個地方
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.85,0:14:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,比起留學 比起自己的將來 她更優先考慮學校
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.45,0:14:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,一直都在努力地維持著這所學校
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.62,0:14:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,在我們所不知道的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.85,0:14:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,作為理事長非常努力地在工作
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.09,0:14:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣的鞠莉 都已經告訴我們沒有辦法了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.04,0:14:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.49,0:14:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,千歌 抱歉啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.53,0:14:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,不是的 不是那樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.87,0:14:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,不是那樣的....
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.90,0:15:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,如果那個時候 我們能在{\fn萝莉体-DDC.yolan}LoveLive{\fn}預選中勝出
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.04,0:15:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,參加總決賽的話
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.27,0:15:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,未來可能就會改變了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.69,0:15:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,未來可能就會不一樣了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.47,0:15:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你這傢伙 差不多也要長茸毛了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.25,0:15:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,今天回來的好晚
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.25,0:15:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,剛才小睦她們來過了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.90,0:15:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\fs37.5\frz270\bord0\c&H000000&\fn@FZZhunYuan-M02\move(943.999,0,961.999,676,11,2100)}目標！LoveLive！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.95,0:15:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\fs37.5\bord0\c&H000000&\fn@FZZhunYuan-M02\frz245.3\move(662,6,663.999,590,2,2100)}下一次一定要優勝！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.95,0:15:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\fs37.5\bord0\c&H000000&\fn@FZZhunYuan-M02\frz291.4\move(1263.999,32.001,1263.999,676,2,2100)}加油哦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.11,0:15:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,這個
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.25,0:16:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 大家一起折好 帶過來給妳加油的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.09,0:16:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,千歌 妳怎麼了？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.78,0:16:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,沒什麼 謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.81,0:16:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,由於諸多事由 說明會中止
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.31,0:16:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,明年這所浦之星女子學院就會與他校合併並廢校
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.90,0:16:21.65,Default-TOP,,0,0,0,,騙人的吧...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.12,0:16:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,對於正在準備說明會的同學們 非常的抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.69,0:16:23.69,Default-TOP,,0,0,0,,已經决定了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.81,0:16:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,但是說明會已經被中止
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.11,0:16:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,請立即將相關海報移除
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.09,0:16:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,真的已經無能為力了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.68,0:16:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,關於這件事我們是無能為力的吧....
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.02,0:16:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,如果還有什麼辦法的話
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.27,0:16:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,千歌她們應該早都已經行動了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.84,0:16:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,好漂亮的夕陽
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.12,0:16:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,事情變成這樣 肯定有些遺憾
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.74,0:17:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,但是一直努力到現在 我覺得也挺好的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.23,0:17:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不像東京 我們在一個這麼小的城市裡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.79,0:17:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,能做到這樣已經很不錯了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.63,0:17:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,妳是說真的嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.12,0:17:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,如果妳真是這麼想的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.07,0:17:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我會瞧不起妳的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.04,0:17:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,嘎哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.26,0:17:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我是普通怪獸梨子
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.94,0:17:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,接招 梨子光波
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.90,0:17:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,是這樣的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.17,0:17:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,妳終於笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.93,0:17:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是{\fn萝莉体-DDC.yolan}Aqours{\fn}的成員
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.61,0:17:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,原本也想著和大家一起繼續唱下去
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.42,0:17:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,也想創作好多好多歌曲
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.21,0:17:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我從沒想過這樣下去是可以的 從來沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.13,0:17:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,梨子..
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.05,0:18:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不知道該怎麼做才好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.19,0:18:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,該怎麼做..才好呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.77,0:18:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,千歌 妳不吃飯嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.21,0:18:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,學校說明會 被中止了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.10,0:18:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,該怎麼做..才好呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.43,0:19:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,早安 我出門了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.29,0:19:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,千歌
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.97,0:19:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,嘎哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.01,0:19:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我一定會引發奇蹟的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.76,0:19:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,在那之前 我不會哭的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.60,0:19:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,不會哭的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.46,0:19:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,果然來了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.35,0:20:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,曜 妳怎麼會在這？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.14,0:20:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道 但是 妳看
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.46,0:20:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,大家
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.30,0:20:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,回過神來的時候 就已經到了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.99,0:20:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,鞠莉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.81,0:20:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,這就是心靈相通吧滋啦？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.47,0:20:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.12,0:20:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我聽到了 從黑暗中傳來的私語
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.83,0:20:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,不是很懂妳
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.25,0:20:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,是的嗎？我知道的哦 一定是的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.03,0:20:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,一定是我們不想放棄
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.61,0:20:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我們只是不想放棄
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.75,0:20:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道鞠莉一直都很努力
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.18,0:20:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 我們大家卻什麼都還沒有做
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.61,0:20:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.74,0:20:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,有可能會是徒勞
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.45,0:20:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 我想一直堅持努力到最後一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.40,0:20:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,想拚一下
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.02,0:20:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,想去尋找僅存的那一點微弱光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.83,0:20:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,想找到這股光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.32,0:20:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,千歌從以前開始 就是一個不會輕言放棄的人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.53,0:20:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,果南妳也是一樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.75,0:20:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,姐姐也是一樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.21,0:21:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,大家覺得怎麼樣？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.13,0:21:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,千歌 大家..
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.93,0:21:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不是挺好的嗎 大家奮力拚這一次
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.92,0:21:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 要做的話就要..
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.61,0:21:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,創造奇蹟
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.12,0:21:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,創造奇蹟
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.37,0:21:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,創造奇蹟
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.63,0:21:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,創造奇蹟
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.94,0:21:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,創造奇蹟
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.13,0:21:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,創造奇蹟
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.29,0:21:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,創造奇蹟
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.49,0:21:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,創造奇蹟
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.12,0:22:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,千歌
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.96,0:22:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,去創造奇蹟吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.02,0:22:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,全力拚搏
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.71,0:22:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,全心全意
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.16,0:22:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,大家一起閃耀到最後
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.39,0:22:19.18,ED_TW,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}努力鼓起勇氣
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.27,0:22:21.75,ED_TW,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}其實卻很膽怯
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.80,0:22:27.62,ED_TW,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}我也不是一開始就能做到的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.93,0:22:30.67,ED_TW,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}經歷過很多挫折
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.77,0:22:33.11,ED_TW,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}後悔的感覺
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.25,0:22:36.18,ED_TW,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}使我變得更堅強
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.21,0:22:38.94,ED_TW,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}永遠不要輕言放棄
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.99,0:22:44.49,ED_TW,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}妳淚眼朦朧地說想要堅定信念
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.59,0:22:49.19,ED_TW,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}將迷惘和眼淚一掃而空
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.22,0:22:50.58,ED_TW,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}出發吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.59,0:22:55.62,ED_TW,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}無論多少次都要去拚搏 不要放棄
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.65,0:22:58.97,ED_TW,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}誰都會有失敗的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.99,0:23:02.00,ED_TW,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}但是夢想不會消失 不會消失的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.02,0:23:07.19,ED_TW,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}無論多少次都要去拚搏 不要放棄
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.43,0:23:12.37,ED_TW,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}因為今天就是今天  一覺醒來
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.40,0:23:15.47,ED_TW,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}又是全新的一天
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.47,0:23:23.13,ED_TW,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}啊 太陽在對我微笑
